          "text": "Hi Doctor, \n\nAs you know, I have been getting menstural cramps for years now, but lately they have gotten worse. I used to tolerate them okay but the cramps are so bad that I can barely move at all, and they're getting worse every month. The only thing that works is heating pads. But even then it's not helping much. So yeah it's gotten to the point that I really wanted to schedule something with you to talk about this. I don't known if I need a stronger NSAID or if there is a new type of medication that can help or if there is something WRONG WITH ME but I really want to try something. \n\nThanks",
